570 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
/E (Organizations frequently introduce changes to processes, technologies, policies, operating models, and workflows. While the requested change may appear limited in scope, its effects can propagate across teams, business processes, systems, data, documentation, dependencies, and operational risks.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
571 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
/E (The AI Change Impact Analyzer is an AI-assisted decision-support product designed to help Business Analysts, Project Managers, and Transformation teams identify and assess these potential impacts before implementation begins.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
572 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
/E (The product accepts a proposed organizational change and relevant contextual information, analyzes the change across predefined impact dimensions, and produces a structured impact assessment covering affected areas, severity, confidence, rationale, risks, dependencies, and recommended actions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
573 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
/E (The system is designed to augment human decision-making rather than replace it. AI-generated findings are presented with contextual reasoning and confidence indicators so that users can review, validate, and refine the analysis before making implementation decisions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
